Z||000000||ArmandoP||01-17-2001||07:04 PM||||hey guys, long time no see!<BR>I am hosting a group purchase on intrax springs, the same people that make springs for F1 cars!!!<BR>anyways, Ive got them REAL cheap, but I need 30 people in on the GP!<BR>the deadline is going to be sometime in mid february, and payment will be by check, money order or paypal.<BR>heres the vitals...<BR>the price for a set of Fiero springs (cold wound, progressive, lifetime warranty, 1.5inh drop!) is....drum roll please.....<BR>$167.50!!!<BR>this is about $7 above wholesale cost!  retail price is $299.<BR>if you are in indiana or illinois, shipping is FREE!!!<BR>if you are in Indiana, there is 5% tax  anywhere else in the continental US, no tax, but add about $10 for shipping.<BR>I have about 17 people in it right now (all mr2's) but the buy is open to any car that they make springs for! (they make em for f-bodies as well, and their even cheaper!)<BR>here is a thread with all the details...<BR> <A HREF="http://board.mr2pages.com/showthread.php?threadid=9072" TARGET=_blank>http://board.mr2pages.com/showthread.php?threadid=9072</A> <BR>if you have any questions, feel free to email me at ajperez@indiana.edu or call me at home. (number below)<BR>Armando 87 MR2<BR>ajperez@indiana.edu<BR>812-323-8083<p>[This message has been edited by ArmandoP (edited 01-17-2001).]||||reg||14
